<p>In Linux, remove or rename files and directories with illegal Windows na=
mes. Then clone to Windows.</p>
<p>Known issues:</p>
<ul>
<li>characters ", *, :, &lt;, &gt;, ?, or \ in the name</li>
<li>any of words "nul", "aux", "prn", "com1" ... "com9", or "lpt1" ... "lpt=
9" in the name. ex: nul.json</li>
<li>name ending with "."</li>
</ul>
    </div>
